OVERVIEW: Import DICOM files into the archive

USAGE: dicom-archive import <files> ... --archive <archive> [--recursive] [--skip-duplicates] [--verbose]

ARGUMENTS:
  <files>                 DICOM files or directories to import

OPTIONS:
  -a, --archive <archive> Path to the archive
  --recursive             Recursive import from directories
  --skip-duplicates       Skip duplicate SOP Instance UIDs without error
  --verbose               Verbose output
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

